YUVRAW_UI_TEXT(PackedFileSize, u8"按 %s 紧凑排列计算，文件 %llu 字节", u8"Packed %s layout; file size %llu bytes")
YUVRAW_UI_TEXT(AmbiguousStrideHelp, u8"带 padding 的排布字节数与紧凑排布相同，无法区分：\n若图像右侧出现绿色竖条，把宽度调小、stride 保持不变", u8"Padded and packed layouts have the same byte count.\nIf a green strip appears on the right, reduce width and keep stride unchanged.")
YUVRAW_UI_TEXT(BytesPerRow, u8"字节/行", u8"bytes/row")
YUVRAW_UI_TEXT(StrideHelp, u8"第 0 平面每行的字节数，含行尾 padding。\n默认是按当前格式与宽度紧凑排列的字节数。\n相机 dump 的 YUV 常按 16/32/64 字节对齐，\n例如 1440 宽的 NV21 实际 stride 可能是 1472。\n图像右侧出现绿色竖条通常就是没填对 stride。", u8"Bytes per row in plane 0, including padding.\nDefaults to the packed row size for this format and width.\nCamera YUV dumps often align to 16/32/64 bytes.\nFor example, 1440-wide NV21 may have a stride of 1472.\nA green strip on the right usually indicates an incorrect stride.")
YUVRAW_UI_TEXT(BayerPattern, u8"Bayer 排布", u8"Bayer pattern")
YUVRAW_UI_TEXT(BayerPatternHelp, u8"左上角 2x2 的滤色片排列。\n选错时整幅图颜色会明显翻车（红绿互换等）。", u8"Color filter arrangement in the top-left 2x2 block.\nAn incorrect pattern causes strong color shifts, such as swapped red and green.")
